                                                "sense_id": "e636a66f-9c47-39c9-9200-f7feddb15256",
                                                "text": "I saw red and smashed a plate and a bowl. […] I swept up the mess. I bawled a lot as I swept […] I also thought, I am about to get my period. It absolutely shits me that this should explain anything."
                                            }
